---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = 'Legal notice — Publitools';
const description = 'Full legal notice for the Publitools website published by PubliTech OÜ.';
---
<Layout title={title} description={description} canonical="https://publitools.ai/en/legal-notice" locale="en" pathname="/en/legal-notice/">
  <main class="container section-pad">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#f4862d]">Legal information</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 max-w-4xl text-5xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#262832]">Legal notice</h1>
    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 text-[#5b6170]">
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">1. Website publisher</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">This website, published under the name Publitools, is edited by <strong class="text-[#262832]">PubliTech OÜ</strong>, a company registered under registry code <strong class="text-[#262832]">17324362</strong>, VAT number <strong class="text-[#262832]">EE102901191</strong>, headquartered at <strong class="text-[#262832]">Harju maakond, Tallinn, Kesklinna linnaosa, Tornimäe tn 5, 10145</strong>.</p>
        <p class="mt-4">Publitools is the commercial name of the tool presented on this site.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">2. Activity</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">The Publitools site is intended to present and sell software services and digital marketing automation tools dedicated in particular to contractors, construction businesses and building companies.</p>
        <p class="mt-4">Features may include social media management, customer reviews handling, and local visibility on Google Business.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">3. Hosting and infrastructure</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">The site may be hosted on technical infrastructure operated by specialised third-party providers. Hosting, delivery and technical operations may evolve based on operational needs.</p>
        <p class="mt-4">All technical elements of the site, including content, visuals, pages, scripts and components, are published under the publisher's responsibility.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">4. Intellectual property</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">All elements on the site, including but not limited to texts, visuals, illustrations, logos, graphic elements, components, structural bases, marketing content and distinctive signs, are protected by intellectual property law and remain the exclusive property of PubliTech OÜ or its partners, unless stated otherwise.</p>
        <p class="mt-4">Any reproduction, representation, adaptation, distribution or exploitation, in whole or in part, without prior written authorisation, is prohibited.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">5. Liability</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">The publisher strives to ensure the accuracy and update of the information published on the site. However, it cannot guarantee the absence of errors, omissions, temporary unavailability or occasional inaccuracies.</p>
        <p class="mt-4">The user acknowledges using the site's information under their sole responsibility. The publisher shall not be liable for direct or indirect damages related to the use of the site or the temporary inability to access it.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">6. External links</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">The site may contain links to third-party services or sites. The publisher does not exercise permanent control over these external resources and cannot be held responsible for their content, operation or data processing policy.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">7. Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">For any request related to the site, the published content or Publitools activities, the user may use the contact or appointment tools made available on the site.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>